🔧 Configuration
config.py - Complete Reference
python
# config.py

# --- Streaming Settings ---
DEFAULT_RTMP_URL = "rtmp://localhost/live"
DEFAULT_STREAM_KEY = "your-stream-key-here"
FPS = 30
MAX_STREAM_KEY_LENGTH = 30

# --- Window Settings ---
DEFAULT_WINDOW_WIDTH = 1200
DEFAULT_WINDOW_HEIGHT = 800

# --- Audio Settings ---
AUDIO_SAMPLE_RATE = 44100
AUDIO_CHANNELS = 2
AUDIO_BUFFER = 512

# --- AR Effects Settings ---
SMILE_THRESHOLD = 3.2
EYEBROW_THRESHOLD = 7.0
NOSE_THRESHOLD = 0.45
MOVEMENT_TIMEOUT = 3.0

# --- UI Settings ---
APPEARANCE_MODE = "dark"  # "dark", "light", "system"
COLOR_THEME = "blue"     # "blue", "green", "dark-blue"
🚨 Troubleshooting
Common Issues & Solutions
Issue	Solution
❌ FFmpeg not found	Download from ffmpeg.org and place in project folder or add to PATH
❌ Camera not working	Check camera permissions, try different camera index (change cv2.VideoCapture(0) to 1)
❌ No audio from video	Ensure FFmpeg is installed for audio extraction, or use MP3 files directly
❌ Black screen on video	Check video codec support (H.264 recommended), convert video using FFmpeg
❌ Streaming fails	Verify RTMP URL and Stream Key are correct, check internet connection
❌ MediaPipe import error	Install mediapipe==0.10.7 or use cvzone fallback
❌ High CPU usage	Reduce video resolution, lower FPS, close background applications
